      "text": "🗞️ Crypto 24H Recap 🧵\n\nGlobal mkt cap: $3.91T (+3.6%)\nVol: $258B — strong across BTC, DeFi & institutions.\nBig moves, key updates. Let’s dive in:\n#CryptoNews #BTC #ETH #DeFi\n\n---\n\n1️⃣ U.S. Bitcoin Reserve CONFIRMED 🇺🇸\nBo Hines: “We want as much BTC as we can possibly get.”\nAccumulation is on.\n#Bitcoin #BTC #WhiteHouse\n\n2️⃣ Phoenix Group deploys $150M treasury 🇦🇪\n514 BTC + 630K SOL. First on ADX.\nBullish institutional signal.\n#CryptoTreasury #SOL #BTC\n\n3️⃣ Whales taking profits 🐋\nBTC rally → realized gains.\nShort-term caution?\n#Bitcoin #CryptoMarket\n\n4️⃣ White House crypto report drops 🏛️\n✔️ DeFi clarity\n✔️ Stablecoin framework\n❌ No BTC reserve details\n#CryptoRegulation #DeFi #Stablecoins\n\n---\n\n5️⃣ Fake crypto apps flagged ⚠️\nMalware-laced ads running.\nStay safe — verify before you download.\n#CryptoSecurity #DYOR\n\n6️⃣ $44M theft inside CoinDCX 🇮🇳\nEmployee arrested.\nCEXs still vulnerable to internal risk.\n#CoinDCX #CryptoScam\n\n7️⃣ South Korea sets Aug deadline 🇰🇷\nCrypto lending guidelines incoming.\nFocus: user protection + risk.\n#CryptoLending #SouthKorea\n\n---\n\n8️⃣ SEC ETF approvals fix backend, not demand 🇺🇸\nRetail hype still muted.\nStructural reform > inflow spike.\n#ETFs #SEC #CryptoInvesting\n\n9️⃣ ETH outperforms tech stocks 🚀\nBiggest monthly gain in 3 years.\nETH momentum building.\n#ETH #Ethereum #Altseason\n\n🔟 Philippines responds to Polygon outage 🇵🇭\nGovt confirms blockchain ops resume.\nCommitment to Web3 strong.\n#Polygon #Web3 #Philippines\n\n---\n\n1️⃣1️⃣ $100B+ in ETH treasuries 💰\nInstitutions going long.\nETH = treasury-grade asset now.\n#Ethereum #Institutions #ETH\n\n1️⃣2️⃣ EU-backed stablecoin $EURAU goes live 🇪🇺\nLaunching via AllUnity.\nRegulated Euro play.\n#Stablecoins #EURAU #EUcrypto\n\n1️⃣3️⃣ Blockstream drops Simplicity 🧠\nBTC-native smart contract platform.\nLayer-2 DeFi is coming.\n#Bitcoin #SmartContracts #Blockstream\n\nFollow for daily crypto digests 🔔\n#Crypto #Blockc